        given-names: "Huijun"
    year: 2026
    doi: "10.1016/j.ymssp.2026.114138"
    journal: "Mechanical Systems and Signal Processing"
    volume: 250
    notes: "Article no. 114138. Open access under CC BY 4.0. Secondary method reference; supplies the architecture and hyperparameter details the conference paper omits."

  # ---------------------------------------------------------------------
  # The two citations required by the RIAWELC dataset authors. Both are
  # mandatory usage terms of the dataset, not optional attribution.
  # ---------------------------------------------------------------------
  - type: conference-paper
    title: "RIAWELC: A Novel Dataset of Radiographic Images for Automatic Weld Defects Classification"
